# Her day (one topic a day). Her line answers "how's your day", from her mood, what happened to her today and her voice.
# Slots: name you laugh pet voice tone mood moodword thing period place club exam rel; {who} when something happened with another girl.

# ---------------- you ask ----------------
@rule me.day.plain
on me.day
- [How's your day going|How's today treating you|How has your day been], {name}?
- [So|Hey], how's [the day|everything] going?
- You doing okay today?
- [How was class today?|Did today go okay?|Anything happen in class?]
- [You look like you have a story.|You seem to be in a mood.] [What happened?|How's today treating you?]
- [Got a minute?|Are you busy?] [How's your day so far?|I wanted to see how you're doing.]
- [I haven't seen you all day.|Long time no see, huh?] [How's it going?|What have you been up to?]
- [So, tell me about your day.|Tell me something about today.|What's new with you?]

@rule me.day.who
on me.day
when verb=ate_with kind=day
- How was lunch with {who}?
- [Did you|So you] have lunch with {who}? How was it?
- [I saw you eating with {who}.|You and {who} at lunch, huh?] What did you two talk about?
- [Everything okay with {who}?|Is {who} around today?] [Just asking.|How are things?]
- [I saw you with {who} earlier.|You and {who} looked busy.] [How's your day?|What was that about?]
- [Did you and {who} get lunch?|Were you with {who} all morning?]
- [{Who} mentioned you.|I ran into {who}.] [How's your day been?|So, how are you?]
- [How's {who} doing?|Is {who} treating you well?] [And you?|And how are you?]

@rule me.day.fight
on me.day
when verb=fought|insulted kind=day
- I heard something happened with {who}. You okay?
- Is everything alright between you and {who}?
- [People are saying you and {who} argued.|I heard you and {who} fell out.] Want to talk about it?
- [Are you okay after that thing with {who}?|I heard about you and {who}.] [Want to talk?|How are you holding up?]
- [You and {who} still not talking?|Still fighting with {who}?]
- [I noticed you avoiding {who}.|It's tense between you and {who}, huh?] [How's your day?|You all right?]
- [Is it true you had it out with {who}?|Heard you and {who} went at it.]
- [I won't ask about {who} if you don't want me to.|Forget {who} for a minute.] [How are you?|How's the rest of your day?]

@rule me.day.madeup
on me.day
when verb=made_up kind=day
- So you and {who} are good again?
- [I saw you and {who} talking again.|Heard you patched things up with {who}.] Glad?
- [You and {who} made up, right?|Peace with {who} at last?] That's good to hear.
- [So you and {who} are good now?|All fixed with {who}?]
- [You look better since you talked to {who}.|Glad it worked out with {who}.] [How's your day?|You okay?]
- [Who apologized first, you or {who}?|Did {who} say sorry?]
- [I saw you laughing with {who} again.|You and {who} are back to normal?] [That's nice.|That's a relief.]
- [I knew you and {who} would be fine.|Told you it would blow over with {who}.]

@rule me.day.dating
on me.day
when verb=started_dating kind=day
- So... you and {who}, huh?
- [Word is you're going out with {who} now.|You and {who}? Since when?]
- [So it's true about you and {who}?|Congratulations, I think? You and {who}.]
- [So when did you and {who} happen?|You kept that quiet. You and {who}?]
- [People won't stop talking about you and {who}.|The whole class knows about you and {who}.]
- [Are you happy with {who}?|Is {who} good to you?]
- [You and {who}, huh? I didn't see that coming.|Wait, {who}? Really?]
- [Should I congratulate you for {who}?|So I hear you're taken. By {who}?]

@rule me.day.close
on me.day
when rel=girlfriend|lover
- Hey, you. How's [my favorite person|your day] [doing|going]?
- [There you are.|Hey.] How's your day been?
- [Hi, beautiful.|Hey, you.] [Did you miss me today?|Tell me about your day.]
- [Was today okay?|How was your day, really?] [You can tell me.|I'm all yours.]
- {student}[I thought about you in class.|I've been waiting to see you.] [How's your day?|Tell me everything.]
- [Come here. How are you?|Good to see you. Rough day?]
- [Did you eat?|Did you sleep okay?] [I worry, you know.|How are you feeling?]
- [Anything I should know about today?|So, what's my girl been up to?]

